    "detailed_description": "Video 2 Live Wallpaper is a free and easy-to-use app for Windows to play/set videos as live desktop wallpapers. Simply drag a video into the app window and click &quot;Make Wallpaper&quot; or press the <i>Shift + F</i> hotkey. <i>That's it!</i><br><br><strong>Additional Features</strong> (<i>optional toggles</i>):<br><br>- Image wallpapers.<br>- Audio playback (from video).<br><br>- Live spectrum visualizer -&gt; pickup any audio playing on the computer.<br>- Live system/hardware info -&gt; print current CPU/GPU/memory stats.<br>- Interactive date-time label.",
